§ `s 57 WRA2007 11F: persons subject to work preparation and work-focused interview requirement`

-- line 1025: a person who does not fall within section 11D or 11E falls within section 11F
#ASSERT `s 57 WRA2007 11F(1) the person falls within section 11F` (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 57 WRA2007 11F(1) the person falls within section 11F` (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 57 WRA2007 11F(1) the person falls within section 11F` (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
